  "instructions": "Review this hash-bound AI-provisional package field by field. Accept, reject or request clarification for each experimental scope, factor/comparator, endpoint, result, linkage, missing-method limitation and permissible interpretation. Assess alignment/context and terminal outcome separately. Human responses are review records only; they do not confer scientific authorization, Strict Core or Human Gold. Test-account submissions in staging are synthetic workflow events, never human scientific validation. Cases may contain zero sources or failed stages. Review missing evidence and terminal honesty without inventing an experimental observation; clarification is a valid response.",
